---

NOTE ON DATA: there is no third-party data in this project, and no exception to
the grant above.

Every event FactoryStream processes is produced by its own generator from a
seed. There is no external feed, no API, no licensed dataset, and therefore no
attribution, share-alike, or redistribution obligation attached to anything this
repository emits. The MIT grant covers the code, and the code is all there is.

The plant it simulates is fictional. No employer schema, machine name, cycle
time, defect rate, or process detail informs any part of it — a binding
non-goal, not a sanitisation step. See plant/canon.yaml.
